{
  "id": "lowfield-schumann-783-harmonics",
  "name": "Schumann 7.83 Hz with SR harmonics",
  "category": "lowfield",
  "evidence": "claim",
  "origin": "Popular Schumann-resonance device concept (hypothesis: Cherry 2002); tested in an RCT by Huang et al. 2022 (Chang Gung, Taiwan)",
  "uT": 1,
  "summary": "The Schumann program with the higher resonance modes added: about 7.83, 14.1, 20.3, 26.4 and 32.5 Hz summed at falling amplitudes, 30 min on all eight ring coils in phase. Claim-level, like the fundamental-only version.",
  "notes": "The mode frequencies follow Ouyang 2013 (7.8, 14.1, 20.3, 26.4 and 32.5 Hz). The sources give no amplitudes for the higher modes beyond 'lower'; this program uses 1, 1/2, 1/3, 1/4 and 1/5 (a project choice) and scales the sum so its peak equals the set intensity, so the fundamental alone is about 56% of it. The sum is a 12-s loop of 8000 points at 1.5 ms, which puts the modes at 7.833, 14.083, 20.333, 26.417, 32.5 Hz. The natural Schumann resonance is a field of about 1 pT near 7.8 Hz (the fundamental drifts between about 7.2 and 8.2 Hz over the day); even at 1 uT the helmet is about a million times stronger, so this is not a 'natural' field. Cherry 2002 proposed health effects via melatonin as a hypothesis. Huang 2022 put a device by the bed facing the head, switched on about 1 h before bed until rising, for 4 weeks, with a composite 7.83 Hz plus theta and delta signal (this program adds the resonance modes but not Huang's theta and delta parts) and no reported field strength; polysomnography showed no between-group difference, and a co-author held the patent licence. Danho 2025 used 1 uT at 7.83 Hz (outcome: jump performance) with a no-exposure control but no sham. At about 1e-6 V/m induced field there is no credible mechanism. Treat it as claim-level and test it against sham with the app's Blind option. No sleep or health benefit is promised; stop on discomfort.",
  "setting": "Evening, lying down in a quiet, dim room; 30-60 min (Huang 2022 ran the device from about 1 h before bed until rising). All eight ring coils in phase, as there is no evidence-based placement.",
  "schedule": "Huang 2022: every night for 4 weeks.",
  "targets": [],
